erif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">
I am your constituent. I live at 82900 Highway 101, Florence, Oregon 97439,=
 in House District 9.</div>
<div class=3D"elementToProof" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, &quot;Aptos_Embe=
ddedFont&quot;, &quot;Aptos_MSFontService&quot;, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-s=
erif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">
<br>
</div>
<div class=3D"elementToProof" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, &quot;Aptos_Embe=
ddedFont&quot;, &quot;Aptos_MSFontService&quot;, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-s=
erif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">
The attached letter concerns Statewide HR Policy 50.010.02, Violence-Free W=
orkplace, issued by the DAS Chief Human Resources Office and applying to ev=
ery executive branch agency in Oregon. It asks you to look at two sections =
of one document.</div>
<div class=3D"elementToProof" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, &quot;Aptos_Embe=
ddedFont&quot;, &quot;Aptos_MSFontService&quot;, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-s=
erif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">
<br>
</div>
<div class=3D"elementToProof" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, &quot;Aptos_Embe=
ddedFont&quot;, &quot;Aptos_MSFontService&quot;, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-s=
erif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">
Section 7 lists who may be barred and terminated under the policy, and name=
s volunteers explicitly. Section 8 prohibits retaliation against those who =
report or experience workplace violence, and names employees only. The same=
 document brings volunteers inside
 its enforcement reach and leaves them outside its protection.</div>
<div class=3D"elementToProof" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, &quot;Aptos_Embe=
ddedFont&quot;, &quot;Aptos_MSFontService&quot;, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-s=
erif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">
<br>
</div>
<div class=3D"elementToProof" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, &quot;Aptos_Embe=
ddedFont&quot;, &quot;Aptos_MSFontService&quot;, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-s=
erif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">
The letter asks three things of you, none of which require a bill or a comm=
ittee: read those two sections and satisfy yourself I have described them a=
ccurately; submit a legislative information request to DAS for the number o=
f behavioral threat assessments
 initiated by executive branch agencies since January 1, 2023, and for the =
current and superseded versions of the policy; and ask DAS-CHRO in writing =
what protection 50.010.02 affords a volunteer who reports workplace violenc=
e.</div>
<div class=3D"elementToProof" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, &quot;Aptos_Embe=
ddedFont&quot;, &quot;Aptos_MSFontService&quot;, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-s=
erif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">
<br>
</div>
<div class=3D"elementToProof" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, &quot;Aptos_Embe=
ddedFont&quot;, &quot;Aptos_MSFontService&quot;, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-s=
erif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">
Section III sets out why I am asking. It is documented, and one part of it =
bears on my credibility rather than the agency's: the Oregon State Police d=
ispatch record for the visit to my home states it was made for the Forest S=
ervice, and the District Ranger
 for the Central Coast Ranger District has since stated in writing that the=
 Forest Service did not initiate it. I have been the volunteer caretaker at=
 that federal facility for more than a year and remain in the position toda=
y.</div>
<div class=3D"elementToProof" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, &quot;Aptos_Embe=
ddedFont&quot;, &quot;Aptos_MSFontService&quot;, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-s=
erif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">
<br>
</div>
<div class=3D"elementToProof" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, &quot;Aptos_Embe=
ddedFont&quot;, &quot;Aptos_MSFontService&quot;, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-s=
erif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">
Senator Anderson is copied as my senator in District 5. Director Sumption, =
the DAS Chief Human Resources Office, and the Office of the Governor are co=
pied because the letter concerns a policy DAS issues and OPRD administers, =
and because I do not send anything
 about an agency that the agency does not receive. My complete record of co=
ntact with OPRD is available in the archive I steward.</div>
<div class=3D"elementToProof" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, &quot;Aptos_Embe=
ddedFont&quot;, &quot;Aptos_MSFontService&quot;, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-s=
